	</div>

	  <div class="nav-row">
		<a href="https://eyk0001.github.io/Income-vs-Housing-Market/Price%20Growth%20vs%20Wage%20Growth.html">Price vs Wage Growth</a>
		<a href="https://eyk0001.github.io/Income-vs-Housing-Market/Can%20You%20Afford%20to%20Live%20Here.html">Can You Afford to Live Here</a>
